"    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Please find attached the bills and payments still open in our records for your account.</p>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Could you check them against your own statement and let us know of any difference?</p>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0;\">\n"
"        Best regards,<br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"user.name or ''\"/><br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"env.company.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Beste <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,</p>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">In de bijlage vind je de leveranciersfacturen en betalingen die in onze administratie nog openstaan op je rekening.</p>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Kun je ze vergelijken met je eigen overzicht en ons eventuele verschillen laten weten?</p>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0;\">\n"
"        Met vriendelijke groet,<br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"user.name or ''\"/><br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"env.company.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

